Falsifies `byte_glob::verification::matching_is_total`.

The defect: the backtrack no longer advances `star_absorbed`, so the retry resumes at the same name position
with the same pattern position. A pattern like `*a` against `b` loops forever.

Expected to fail: the unwinding assertion on the match loop in `match_steps`, reached through the harness's `match_steps` call: the loop no longer runs out of work.

